OL,3,GNEWSAMan who kidnapped stranger at
OL,4,Agunpoint jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who kidnapped a stranger and
OL,7,Fthreatened to cut his fingers off has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed - after a blow torch,
OL,9,Fhandwritten kidnap list and zip ties
OL,10,Fwere found in his home.
OL,12,FClaude Bond, 32, approached the victim
OL,13,F- man in his 20s - on Hatherley Road,
OL,14,FGloucester at about 18:40 GMT on 11
OL,15,FDecember 2025 before he pushed an
OL,16,Fairsoft pistol into his back and
OL,17,Fescorted him to an address on Hanman
OL,18,FRoad where he was held captive for
OL,19,Fthree hours.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
