OL,3,GNEWSAMan who kidnapped stranger at
OL,4,Agunpoint jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reason for the kidnap was suggested
OL,7,Fto be related to a drug dispute between
OL,8,FBond and a relative of the victim.
OL,10,FBond admitted the offence on 22 June
OL,11,Fand was jailed for four-and-a-half
OL,12,Fyears at Gloucester Crown Court
OL,13,Fearlier.
